      "hn_url": null,
      "snippet": "If the agent isn't using my diagnostics library, I could introspect and update AGENTS.md, but there's still a delta, and it'll drift. Instead, I write a pre-commit hook that checks the git diff for direct calls to observability modules that bypass my diagnostics module. Boom: fail the commit, inject a prompt telling the agent to use the diagnostics library. All of a sudden it's ten out of ten. — Geoffrey Huntley , nobody should type code by hand anymore. here's what's left. Tags: coding-agents , generative-ai , git , agentic-engineering , ai , geoffrey-huntley , llms",
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Geoffrey Huntley",
          "url": "https://ghuntley.com/agency/",
          "site": "ghuntley.com"
        }
      ]
    },
